    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 3,
        "text": "And when the people of the kingdom, the people who lived in her village saw her, they said, Oh! how beautiful she is..."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 14,
        "line": 704,
        "text": "She knew she was dying. She said she wanted to do it right. She wanted to get a video camera and do a thing where she talked to kids about drugs. She knew what it was about. It's about running away. She wanted to tell kids, you can handle it."
      }
